	(text "REMOTE CELL PROBE: Semitec 103AT-2, 10k +/-1%.\nInsulate and bond to the cell. External U13/U14 window\ndisables CE outside approximately 5 to 40 C.\nOpen or short probe inhibits charging; TS uses fixed 10k."
