	(text "GPIO36 ADC: Vcell x270/1270; calibrate ADC, settle >=200 ms.\r\nGPIO39: filtered cell NTC. GPIO35: USB selected when high.\r\nGPIO33: lid switch / RTC wake. GPIO12 must stay low at boot."
