	(text "INPUT: J10 pin 2 = +IN; pin 1 = GND\nUse regulated 5 V DC or a compatible nominal 6 V panel.\nCold panel open-circuit voltage must be below 10.2 V.\nC5: 22 uF, X7R, >=16 V; verify effective capacitance.\n500 mA input ceiling. Fixed VIN-DPM, no MPPT.\nPanel and battery sizing require the load energy budget."
