	(text "J13 JTAG: 1 VTREF, 2 GND, 3 TCK, 4 TMS, 5 TDI, 6 TDO.\nJ14 UART0: 1 GND, 2 VTREF, 3 ESP TX, 4 ESP RX.\nVTREF is an output reference. Do not feed external power into these pins.\nJP1: 1-2 USB default; 2-3 EXT. Fit one shunt only.\nJP2 on bottom: solder closed for USB, also with JP1 fitted. Open JP2 before selecting EXT."
